WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.948 --> 00:00:13.869
is bad," Detective Smith said.

2
00:00:13.889 --> 00:00:18.370
"People all over the city are trapped in their houses.

3
00:00:18.851 --> 00:00:20.811
We'll go to Brenda and Dan Dooley's house first.

4
00:00:21.092 --> 00:00:23.733
They live at "Ten Puddle Lane!"

5
00:00:24.073 --> 00:00:24.853
Roxy took off.

6
00:00:26.774 --> 00:00:27.954
Detective Smith groaned.

7
00:00:27.974 --> 00:00:31.776
"Rocket Girl never—" A police officer ran in.

8
00:00:32.460 --> 00:00:34.061
"Our police cars were stolen!"

9
00:00:34.821 --> 00:00:35.962
The detective groaned again.

10
00:00:43.906 --> 00:00:46.828
No one answered the Dooleys' door, so Roxy entered the house.

11
00:00:46.848 --> 00:00:55.533
"Hello?" Click!

12
00:00:56.233 --> 00:00:57.133
The floor moved.

13
00:00:57.934 --> 00:00:58.774
Roxy jumped up.

14
00:00:59.455 --> 00:01:01.636
Ba-doom! The floor opened.

15
00:01:02.324 --> 00:01:03.165
Roxy flew down.

16
00:01:03.185 --> 00:01:07.367
"Rocket Girl, thank goodness!"

17
00:01:07.647 --> 00:01:08.448
Mr. Dooley said.

18
00:01:08.468 --> 00:01:11.349
"Our phones can't get a signal down here."

19
00:01:12.630 --> 00:01:14.591
Roxy carried the couple out of the dark room.

20
00:01:15.451 --> 00:01:17.813
Mrs. Dooley gasped as they flew through the house.

21
00:01:17.833 --> 00:01:21.435
"Where's our furniture?"

22
00:01:21.455 --> 00:01:23.816
"Our TV is gone!"

23
00:01:24.156 --> 00:01:25.057
Mr. Dooley cried.

24
00:01:26.678 --> 00:01:28.118
Roxy brought them to the front yard.

25
00:01:28.138 --> 00:01:30.560
"How long were you trapped down there?"

26
00:01:31.728 --> 00:01:33.329
"Since yesterday," Mr.

27
00:01:33.349 --> 00:01:33.909
Dooley said.

28
00:01:33.929 --> 00:01:36.890
"Our builder finished working on the house.

29
00:01:37.690 --> 00:01:39.010
He told us to take a look.

30
00:01:40.271 --> 00:01:41.531
Everything looked awful.

31
00:01:42.511 --> 00:01:45.652
Then the floor opened up, and we slid down into that room."

32
00:01:45.672 --> 00:01:49.833
"Who was the builder?"

33
00:01:50.293 --> 00:01:51.034
Roxy asked.

34
00:01:51.054 --> 00:01:54.175
"His name is Jack Hammer," Mrs.

35
00:01:54.215 --> 00:01:54.795
Dooley said.

36
00:01:55.875 --> 00:01:56.875
Mr. Dooley frowned.

37
00:01:56.895 --> 00:01:58.756
"We won't hire him again.

38
00:01:59.312 --> 00:02:01.874
I'm going to give him a bad online review too!"

39
00:02:01.894 --> 00:02:05.998
"Jack Hammer trapped other people," Roxy said.

40
00:02:06.018 --> 00:02:08.139
"I have to stop him!"

41
00:02:09.521 --> 00:02:11.402
Mr. Dooley looked up Jack Hammer on his phone.

42
00:02:12.763 --> 00:02:14.285
He gave the builder's address to Roxy.

43
00:02:15.285 --> 00:02:16.506
Roxy arrived at the office.

44
00:02:17.447 --> 00:02:18.608
It was in an old factory.

45
00:02:22.051 --> 00:02:23.672
A big man sat behind a desk.

46
00:02:24.353 --> 00:02:25.994
He wore overalls and a hard hat.

47
00:02:28.428 --> 00:02:28.988
"Jack Hammer!"

48
00:02:29.008 --> 00:02:29.748
Roxy shouted.

49
00:02:30.649 --> 00:02:31.569
The man stood up.

50
00:02:32.409 --> 00:02:33.709
"Hello, Rocket Girl."

51
00:02:34.590 --> 00:02:35.390
Roxy frowned.

52
00:02:35.410 --> 00:02:38.191
"Why are you trapping people in their houses?"

53
00:02:39.311 --> 00:02:40.031
Jack snorted.

54
00:02:40.051 --> 00:02:41.572
"Why do you think?

55
00:02:42.252 --> 00:02:43.652
I want to steal stuff.

56
00:02:44.352 --> 00:02:45.813
And it's not just houses.

57
00:02:46.573 --> 00:02:49.774
Recently, I worked on police headquarters and a school."

58
00:02:50.854 --> 00:02:52.175
Roxy narrowed her eyes.

59
00:02:52.195 --> 00:02:54.155
"What school?"

60
00:02:54.175 --> 00:02:57.276
"Metro City Elementary."

61
00:02:58.208 --> 00:02:59.568
Jack Hammer looked at his watch.

62
00:02:59.588 --> 00:03:03.470
"In fact, I should probably head over there now."

63
00:03:03.490 --> 00:03:07.111
"Grr!" Roxy rushed toward the villain.

64
00:03:07.611 --> 00:03:08.951
He stepped quickly through a door.

65
00:03:09.552 --> 00:03:12.312
Roxy burst through and found herself in a large, empty room.

66
00:03:12.332 --> 00:03:17.774
"Huh?" The room spun, and Roxy was thrown against a wall.

67
00:03:17.794 --> 00:03:23.596
"Oof!" When the room stopped spinning, Roxy ran through another door.

68
00:03:29.628 --> 00:03:30.689
Mirrors surrounded her.

69
00:03:31.350 --> 00:03:32.711
Her reflection was everywhere.

70
00:03:34.012 --> 00:03:34.752
Roxy gulped.

71
00:03:35.333 --> 00:03:37.614
"I'm stuck in an evil fun house!"

72
00:03:38.515 --> 00:03:39.776
She heard Jack Hammer laugh.

73
00:03:43.479 --> 00:03:45.340
never get out, Rocket Girl!"
